00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:20,180
They beat us, threw us in
the river, struck us dead.

263
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:25,800
I was so terrified of this vigilante
mob that I couldn't sleep at night.

264
00:23:29,060 --> 00:23:31,707
But my grandfather's
crime had been paid for.

265
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:33,280
He was long dead.

266
00:23:34,280 --> 00:23:35,860
You'll pay to Rosamy.

267
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:37,520
We'll kill you all.

268
00:23:41,740 --> 00:23:42,570
Aaaaaaahhh!

269
00:23:46,620 --> 00:23:47,450
Aaaaaaahhh!

270
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:49,520
Your bloodline is evil!

271
00:23:49,820 --> 00:23:51,400
You're a Daimyo killer!

272
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:56,140
It's not my fault!

273
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,941
Doesn't matter if you're a child!

274
00:24:01,340 --> 00:24:03,634
You're a criminal if you're a Kurozumi!

275
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:07,740
You see why I seek revenge now, do you?

276
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:12,120
Every less person in
Wano will feel my fury!

277
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,820
What is this?

278
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:24,220
You're a madman.

279
00:24:28,300 --> 00:24:31,360
I am bringing them the
punishment they deserve!

280
00:24:35,340 --> 00:24:38,046
Orochi, what are you
planning to do with them?

281
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:42,857
In another room, Orochi
was stockpiling weapons,

282
00:24:42,940 --> 00:24:47,280
along with hundreds of people
who had been kidnapped.

283
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:53,917
Once handed over, their fate was sealed.

284
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:57,540
Their very humanity was taken from them.

285
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:03,440
They became tributes.

286
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:06,320
All given away to Kaido.

287
00:25:10,620 --> 00:25:12,620
Oh, those people?

288
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:15,220
They'll be sold and tortured.

289
00:25:15,900 --> 00:25:17,440
Some killed, perhaps.

290
00:25:21,100 --> 00:25:23,080
Lord Odin was furious.

291
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:27,353
But Orochi has stopped the
conflict by making a proposal.

292
00:25:28,860 --> 00:25:31,120
Do you want Bono to go to war?

293
00:25:31,420 --> 00:25:32,320
Think, Odin.

294
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:36,580
Or would you like the kidnappings to stop?

295
00:25:37,040 --> 00:25:39,160
I'd choose wisely if I were you.

296
00:25:39,460 --> 00:25:41,284
There's a lot on the line here.

297
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:45,020
He was driven by hate.

298
00:25:45,220 --> 00:25:46,820
A cruel act of vengeance.

299
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,480
By our pain.

300
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:50,697
Win or lose.

301
00:25:50,780 --> 00:25:54,237
Orochi would cause unspeakable
suffering to this country

302
00:25:54,320 --> 00:25:58,560
Lord Odin's hand was forced
He had no other choice

303
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:04,620
He danced like a fool every week
as an apology to the Kurozumi clan

304
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:09,117
He knew by doing so he would
lose his standing But that

305
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:13,100
didn't matter He could save
100 lives with each dance

306
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:26,280
He trusted Orochi's promise that five years
later, when their ships were finished,

307
00:26:26,540 --> 00:26:28,677
they would leave Wano and never return.

308
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:31,120
But he put too much faith in them.

309
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:37,100
He traveled region to region every week,
ensuring that everything was in order.

310
00:26:40,360 --> 00:26:44,620
The entire time, Lord Odin
has been protecting Wano.

311
00:26:45,500 --> 00:26:47,920
So why don't you tell me again?

312
00:26:48,180 --> 00:26:50,040
Who are you calling a fool?

313
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:00,030
Let's go.

314
00:27:21,900 --> 00:27:24,877
Lord Odin protected us, but
what are we supposed to do?

315
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,677
Why would you tell us this now?

316
00:27:26,760 --> 00:27:28,878
All this is way too hard to swallow.

317
00:27:32,640 --> 00:27:33,840
Let me go!

318
00:27:35,340 --> 00:27:38,400
The truth will only create
strife for this country.

319
00:27:39,180 --> 00:27:40,200
Go to hell!

320
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:44,529
A foolish lord rebelled against
the Shogun and was punished.

321
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:46,357
That's what people will say.

322
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:49,420
We'll be dead in moments,
and all will be settled.

323
00:27:50,560 --> 00:27:53,160
Surely you knew you
would face consequences.

324
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:54,835
You think I'm afraid?

325
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:57,061
I'm one of Lord Odin's retainers!

326
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:59,240
I share my fate with them!

327
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:03,120
Why would I listen to the
barking of Orochi's dogs?

328
00:28:04,100 --> 00:28:08,840
I am prepared to die beside my lord,
but that doesn't mean I'm giving up!

329
00:28:10,340 --> 00:28:11,400
You watch.

330
00:28:11,660 --> 00:28:15,778
All of us will survive, and then
we'll bring an end to your treachery!

331
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:19,100
Hmm, what a joke.

332
00:28:20,780 --> 00:28:21,900
Shogun, please!

333
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:23,520
Stop the execution!

334
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:24,720
This isn't right!

335
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:29,880
I beg of you, my lord!

336
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,780
Please, my lord!

337
00:28:38,300 --> 00:28:39,760
Someone call a doctor!

338
00:28:45,580 --> 00:28:46,880
Ha ha ha ha ha!

339
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:49,630
Orochi!

340
00:28:51,820 --> 00:28:53,620
They were nothing but scuff.

341
00:28:53,940 --> 00:28:58,220
It was not only the shogun's family
who persecuted the Kurozumi clan,

342
00:28:58,460 --> 00:29:00,260
but the common people as well.

343
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:04,120
So when Orochi turned his ire upon them,

344
00:29:04,300 --> 00:29:06,277
they immediately realized what kind of

345
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:09,184
suffering his vengeance
might bring to the land.

346
00:29:11,780 --> 00:29:14,797
meanwhile thanks to
shinobu's passionate words

347
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:17,697
the truth behind odin's
naked dancing spread

348
00:29:17,780 --> 00:29:19,837
quickly throughout the
city and the hearts of

349
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:25,037
the people began to change
what then he was the

350
00:29:25,120 --> 00:29:30,657
one who saved us that
day we mocked him for

351
00:29:30,740 --> 00:29:34,077
all those years and he
never said a word he was

352
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:36,157
suffering more than
anyone and he carried that

353
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:39,880
all on his own we're
fools what have we done

354
00:29:42,460 --> 00:29:47,917
from all directions the citizens
rushed to odin knowing now that the

355
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:51,437
daimyo of kuni is not the fool they
thought he was they were filled with

356
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:55,877
regret and as this brave samurai
stood before their eyes facing death

357
00:29:55,960 --> 00:30:00,019
they realized that he was the only
hope left for the future of warner

358
00:30:03,060 --> 00:30:04,160
Lord Odin,

359
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:07,757
you can't leave us I'm sorry
for every wrong thing I said

360
00:30:07,840 --> 00:30:11,500
about you Thank you for keeping
everyone safe all these years

361
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:21,160
It's far too late now
You bunch of brown nosers

362
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:28,640
Ignore them and just Thank you everyone I
shall give him my best He's so honorable

363
00:30:31,560 --> 00:30:33,980
Far from being moved by their pleas,

364
00:30:34,420 --> 00:30:38,596
Orochi could not let the people's
sudden support of Oden go unpunished.

365
00:30:38,980 --> 00:30:43,392
Before they knew it, they were surrounded
by Kaido and Orochi subordinates.

366
00:30:43,520 --> 00:30:44,920
Swords at their back.

367
00:30:45,060 --> 00:30:48,413
They could only stare upon
the cruel execution in terror.

368
00:30:50,040 --> 00:30:55,380
The temperature of the oil rose above a
thousand degrees and continued to climb.

369
00:31:03,020 --> 00:31:07,360
Swift Arrows carried news of the
events to the leaders of each region.

370
00:31:13,080 --> 00:31:17,740
The Letter Arrows Wano fly great
distances with extreme accuracy.

371
00:31:25,060 --> 00:31:31,260
Listen, well, if I survive
this execution by some means,

372
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:33,720
I will change this country.

373
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:38,080
I will open up the land
of Wano to the world.

374
00:31:41,060 --> 00:31:43,837
What are those idiots
battling about over there?

375
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:48,340
You have said before that the borders
of this land should be opened again.

376
00:31:49,060 --> 00:31:54,120
And yet, you also said that our policy
of isolation is tied to the Kozuki clan.

377
00:31:54,460 --> 00:31:57,537
When you traveled the seas
with Whitebeard and Roger,

378
00:31:57,620 --> 00:32:00,091
what secrets of the world did you uncover?

379
00:32:02,940 --> 00:32:04,300
Many years ago,

380
00:32:04,700 --> 00:32:07,157
the ones who decided
that this country should

381
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:11,000
close its borders were
indeed the Kozuki clan.

382
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:16,457
They sought to protect the
land of Wano from an outside

383
00:32:16,540 --> 00:32:20,560
force of overwhelming
might But now this country,

384
00:32:20,780 --> 00:32:23,000
or rather the world,

385
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:26,221
awaits the arrival of a
figure of great importance

386
00:32:28,540 --> 00:32:31,980
Once the promised 800 years
have passed, they will appear

387
00:32:32,520 --> 00:32:33,660
And when they do,

388
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:38,000
this country must be welcoming to
them and ready to work by their side

389
00:32:41,460 --> 00:32:43,560
I will be clear with you.

390
00:32:48,860 --> 00:32:51,200
Today will not be a victory,

391
00:32:52,360 --> 00:32:55,520
for I am certain that
they are going to kill me.

392
00:32:58,500 --> 00:32:59,357
Hey, Lord!

393
00:32:59,440 --> 00:33:00,380
Stop it!

394
00:33:00,560 --> 00:33:02,795
You have the strength to survive this!

395
00:33:02,980 --> 00:33:05,360
A third of the time has already passed!

396
00:33:06,140 --> 00:33:08,380
Take up the cause in my stead.

397
00:33:09,860 --> 00:33:12,800
You must open the land of Wano.

398
00:33:14,420 --> 00:33:17,000
We'll do it, but we'll do it by your side.

399
00:33:18,080 --> 00:33:19,760
We have heard your dream.

400
00:33:20,060 --> 00:33:22,200
And it shall be our dream as well.

401
00:33:24,820 --> 00:33:26,940
Well spoken, my friend.

402
00:33:31,360 --> 00:33:32,480
All right.

403
00:33:32,840 --> 00:33:34,075
Thirty minutes to go.

404
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:41,060
The boiling oil that cooked Odin's
flesh created a living hell,

405
00:33:41,340 --> 00:33:43,520
not only for him, but his retainers.

406
00:33:45,540 --> 00:33:47,160
This is absurd!

407
00:33:48,320 --> 00:33:49,150
Hurry!

408
00:33:49,520 --> 00:33:52,000
Raise the temperature, you dolds!

409
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:01,080
Only ten minutes left!

410
00:34:05,360 --> 00:34:07,860
Why in the hell are you so tough?

411
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:09,220
Burn already!

412
00:34:10,020 --> 00:34:12,060
Just five minutes.

413
00:34:15,460 --> 00:34:17,560
One minute left!

414
00:34:19,100 --> 00:34:20,840
Ten seconds!

415
00:34:23,240 --> 00:34:24,980
Three seconds.

416
00:34:28,760 --> 00:34:30,140
Come on.

417
00:34:31,720 --> 00:34:33,400
One second!

418
00:34:43,780 --> 00:34:45,800
It's a miracle!

419
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:48,060
He survived the execution!

420
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,220
Come on, please!

421
00:34:52,580 --> 00:34:54,620
Lord Odin is too tough to boil!

422
00:34:56,420 --> 00:34:57,640
He did it.

423
00:34:59,140 --> 00:35:01,220
Lord Odin wins the name!

424
00:35:01,620 --> 00:35:03,917
And his name has been cleared as well!

425
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:07,941
The citizens will surely take his
side now that they know the truth

426
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,920
Ready for a fight, eh, Kaido?

427
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:14,080
Don't taunt him, stupid cat! Why not?

428
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,419
We won, didn't we?

429
00:35:23,820 --> 00:35:26,697
I changed my mind a minute
ago and decided to go

430
00:35:26,780 --> 00:35:29,839
with Death by Firing Squad
instead of the other deer

431
00:35:30,980 --> 00:35:33,720
And Odin's not the only
one we're executing!

432
00:35:34,300 --> 00:35:36,740
His entire family will be killed as well!

433
00:35:40,660 --> 00:35:43,140
A child is excused from a coward!

434
00:35:43,420 --> 00:35:44,837
That's not what you promised!

435
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:46,391
Lord Odin bought his car!

436
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:54,515
If you've got a problem, then step up!

437
00:35:54,660 --> 00:35:57,072
We've got plenty of bullets to go around!

438
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:05,280
I'm counting on you.

439
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,720
Make me proud!

440
00:36:08,240 --> 00:36:11,780
You must open up the land of water!

441
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,720
Odward!

442
00:36:35,100 --> 00:36:36,060
Takuri!

443
00:36:39,420 --> 00:36:40,820
Jinbe!

444
00:36:46,020 --> 00:36:48,220
Do not look back!

445
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,900
Kozuki Oden!

446
00:36:56,900 --> 00:37:00,600
Pardon me, I couldn't help but
overhear what you just said.

447
00:37:02,820 --> 00:37:04,000
Kill them!

448
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:05,720
Kill them all!

449
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:11,400
After them!

450
00:37:11,780 --> 00:37:14,800
Kill every last member of the Kozuki clan!

451
00:37:15,460 --> 00:37:20,500
No matter what happens next, your
body's already damaged beyond repair.

452
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:24,800
I'll give you a parting gift,
a nice bullet to the head.

453
00:37:26,540 --> 00:37:30,260
It seems the era of
Kozuki is over for good.

454
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:33,020
All of you are dead.

455
00:37:34,500 --> 00:37:38,180
You have underestimated my samurai, Kaido.

456
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:43,685
What a lord, I would hate you.

457
00:37:45,060 --> 00:37:46,620
That food isn't yours.

458
00:37:47,740 --> 00:37:48,837
Are you listening?

459
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:49,880
Put that back.

460
00:38:03,100 --> 00:38:05,100
Whoa! I give up! I give up!

461
00:38:05,260 --> 00:38:06,672
I thought you were dead!

462
00:38:18,120 --> 00:38:20,020
Why must I end this way?

463
00:38:27,640 --> 00:38:30,880
This hellhole is the only
home that I will ever know!

464
00:38:31,220 --> 00:38:34,980
A pampered bastard like you
could never understand my life!

465
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:38,242
You're telling me this is
the life that you want!

466
00:38:47,060 --> 00:38:48,260
Such cruelty!

467
00:38:48,600 --> 00:38:49,520
Shame on you!

468
00:38:49,940 --> 00:38:53,469
Those are children you bastards
trying to burn at the stake!

469
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,440
Why am I so hungry?

470
00:39:00,100 --> 00:39:03,159
Because you lent all our
money and now we can't eat!

471
00:39:12,220 --> 00:39:13,340
I've got it!

472
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:16,097
Steal some food and bring it back here!

473
00:39:16,180 --> 00:39:18,080
A dino shouldn't say that!

474
00:39:24,700 --> 00:39:28,337
though i'm sure this is
not the end you envisioned

475
00:39:28,420 --> 00:39:31,037
people will speak of your heroic death for

476
00:39:31,120 --> 00:39:35,537
generations to come they
can call me a hero or a

477
00:39:35,620 --> 00:39:41,600
fool they can even forget
me if they so please But...

478
00:39:45,980 --> 00:39:50,100
No matter what, my spirit will live on!

479
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:54,737
I'm not proud of what
happened with that old hag.

480
00:39:54,820 --> 00:39:56,780
Rest assured, she's dead.

481
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,057
Killed her, did you?

482
00:40:00,140 --> 00:40:01,657
Well, aren't you noble?

483
00:40:01,740 --> 00:40:04,000
Build your strength while you can.

484
00:40:07,120 --> 00:40:11,597
I will be happy if people

485
00:40:11,680 --> 00:40:14,320
tell my story over a drink.

486
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:25,460
My loyal samurai, Toki,
Momonosuke, Hiyori.

487
00:40:31,180 --> 00:40:33,520
I go forth.

488
00:40:41,460 --> 00:40:43,780
Alden wouldn't be Alden!

489
00:41:15,420 --> 00:41:20,060
Would it be Elrond if
it wasn't for at all?

490
00:41:36,680 --> 00:41:41,460
Once one legend comes to an
end, yet the story continues,

491
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:45,040
carried on by new players on a new stage.
